[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0010","text":"…………嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0020","text":"…………！\n树里……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0030","text":"……什么啊，是凛世啊……\n吓我一跳……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0040","text":"……非常抱歉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0050","text":"呀，没事\n……就是，有点睡不着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0060","text":"……想起以前的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0070","text":"我刚来这里的时候，\n大叔他主动跟我搭话来着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0080","text":"明明还是在作为放学后CLIMAX GIRLS出道之前，\n却说着“是艺人啊。好厉害啊……”之类的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0090","text":"大叔和商店街的大家\n都亲切地跟我搭话，慢慢就聊得起来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0100","text":"我啊，越来越喜欢这条街了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0110","text":"是的……\n凛世也是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0120","text":"所以我一直在想。现在的我能做些什么呢\n——但是，一直找不到答案"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0130","text":"……不过，哪怕只是一点点，我也想向前走"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0140","text":"哪怕是一点一点地积累些什么，\n我也想要改变"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0150","text":"树里……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0160","text":"啊哈哈，抱歉啊！\n大半夜的，说这些奇怪的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0170","text":"不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0180","text":"——啊……\n总之今天先睡了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0190","text":"晚安，凛世"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_03030000_04_0200","text":"晚安……"}]
